Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:13:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/19] Claude Code plugin: optional status badges

Plugins > Show Status Badges shows each session's status as its badge,
the label drawn in the terminal's top-right corner, on the status color.
It is off by default and kept in konsolerc ([ClaudeCode]
ShowStatusBadges). While a status badge shows, the session's own badge
(enabled, text, color, text-only) is put aside, and it comes back as it
was when the status clears or badges are turned off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
